mapping "V3492.1" source="V3492" target="274913009" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V3492 = Swedish extension of V34.9 (occupant of three-wheeled MV injured in collision
        with heavy transport vehicle/bus, unspecified occupant, traffic accident) + activity context
        SNOMED CT 274913009 (work). Target SNOMED CT 433930 = (concept_code 274913009). The Athena ICD10
        crosswalk maps V34.9 to 433930; the Swedish extension adds activity context (work) which has no
        SNOMED CT representation, plus the source already drops occupant role and the counterparty
        specificity (heavy truck/bus). 433930 fully subsumes the traffic-accident axis but loses the
        activity, role, and counterparty detail. (low): broader with multiple specificity drops
        (activity context + counterparty + occupant unspecified).
        """
}
